# Code owners for TruLens.
#
# Ownership here is the authoritative record of Area Reviewer scope. See
# CONTRIBUTOR_LADDER.md for how paths get assigned and MAINTAINERS.md for the
# current roster.
#
# NOTE: GitHub ignores CODEOWNERS entries for accounts without write access, so
# Triagers cannot appear here. Advisory review routing for Triagers lives in
# .github/area-reviewers.yml instead. Proposed owners below are carried as
# comments until they reach Area Reviewer, at which point the line is
# uncommented in the same PR that grants scoped write access.
#
# ORDER MATTERS: for CODEOWNERS the LAST matching pattern wins, not the union of
# matches. Broad areas are listed first and narrower ones after, so that a
# specific owner overrides the surrounding area rather than being shadowed by it.

# Default: any path not matched below.
*                                       @truera/trulens-maintainers

